lunduke-about (0.2.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * RAM accounting: per-app rows use RssAnon only (private heap from
    /proc/<pid>/status); LCOS System = physical used (MemTotal - MemAvailable)
    minus sum of listed-app RssAnon (RssFile/shared + RssShmem stay in System
    once, no double-count across GTK apps). Negative residual clamped to 0.
  * Force Close, list, RAM bar, Supporters, window size, icons unchanged.

 -- Phil <phil@brushpad.local>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 16:30:00 -0500

